 Let
 $$\sigma_1:=\sum_{k=1}^\infty \frac{\binom{4k}{k}}{16^k}\l(P(k)H_{k}-54k+108-\frac{10}{3k}\r).$$
 Taking the derivative and the second-order derivative of $F_1(x)$, we deduce that
 \begin{align*}
