 &+O\left(\frac{x^{1+\varepsilon}}{T}\right)\\
 =&P_{0}(\log x)x+I_{2,2}^1+I_{2,2}^2+I_{2,2}^3+O\left(\frac{x^{1+\varepsilon}}{T}\right),
\end{align*}
where $P_{0}(y)$ is some constant polynomial.

