\begin{theorem}\label{thm:equality}
    The three polynomials above are all equal to the cave polynomial. That is, for any polymatroid $\sP$, we have 
    \[\cave_{\sP}(\bft) = \Stal_{\sP}(\bft) = \mathrm{Box}_{\sP}(\bft) = \Mob_{\sP}(\bft).\]
\end{theorem}

