 \]
which satisfies \eqref{NLWE} if $x$ is not on the support of $\chi_{{}_W}$.  For any $N\in {\mathbb N}$ and any interval $[T_0,T]_{x_0}$,  there exists a unique solution $u(h,V,W,x)$ of \eqref{NLWE}  such that 
\[
