Moreover, for any $\tau>0$, the error term satisfies
\[
\begin{split}
& \sup_{x_0\in [-\tau,\tau]}\| \mce_N\|_{{}_{L^2({\mathbb R}^n)}}\leq C(N,\tau), \;\  
\sup_{x_0\in [-\tau,\tau]}\| \mce_N\|_{{}_{L^\infty ({\mathbb R}^n)}}\leq C(N,\tau), \\
