\begin{Lem}\label{lem:offdiag}
	Assume that $(A_1)$ hold.
	There exists a constant $C=C(N,p)>0$ such that for any $R>0$, $r\ge 1$, and $u,v\in L^{p^\prime}(\mathbb{R}^N)$ with $\operatorname{supp}(u)\subset B_R$ and $\operatorname{supp}(v)\subset \mathbb{R}^N\setminus B_{R+r}$, one has
	\begin{equation}\label{eq:offdiag}
