\begin{thm}\label{thm1_2}
Let $n \geq 2$ and $\Omega \subset \mathbb{R}^n$ be a smooth bounded domain. Suppose that $(\ref{f})$ and $(\ref{g})$ hold with $p,q \in \mathbb{R}$ satisfying 
\begin{align}\label{pq-global}
p>\frac{n-2}{n-1} \ \text{ or } \ q>\frac{n-2}{n-1}, 
