As in Case 1, along with $\lambda \geq 2\|n\underline{W}_s\|_{L^{\infty}([0, R^n] \times [0, T_0])}$, we can conclude that (\ref{eq2_14}) is also false. 

Combining these two cases, we therefore obtain \eqref{eq2_12}. As a consequence of letting $\varepsilon \searrow 0$ and $T_0 \nearrow T$, \eqref{eq2_10} follows.
\end{proof}

