\label{corollary: G' fg}
    Let $f\in \mathbb{C}[x]$ be a periodic quadratic polynomial and $G:=\mathrm{IMG}(f)$. Then, every normal subgroup $1\ne N\trianglelefteq G$ is finitely generated.
