    Let $f\in \mathbb{C}[x]$ be a periodic quadratic polynomial. Then, there exists $b\ge 1$ such that
    $$\mathrm{hspec}_b(\overline{\mathrm{IMG}(f)})=[0,1].$$
\end{corollary}

