\begin{proof}[Proof of Theorem \ref{mainCyc5ecBou}]
 Let $G$ be a flow-admissible, cyclically 5-edge-connected cubic signed graph. By Lemma \ref{sZ6}, $G$ has an orientation $\tau$ and a function $\phi$ satisfying the requirements of Lemma \ref{Z6 to 6}. By Lemma \ref{Z6 to 6}, $G$ has a nowhere-zero 6-flow.
\end{proof}

