\begin{equation}\label{relabel}
\varphi_1^+(x;0)\equiv \varphi_3^-(x;0)\equiv W_0(x), \quad x\in\mathbb{R}.
\end{equation}
The remaining fast modes $\varphi_2^+$ and $\varphi_4^-$ are modified accordingly, but still span the corresponding fast decaying manifolds, while $\varphi_5^-$ is unchanged.

