in a complete noncompact Sasakian manifold with nonnegative transverse
bisectional curvature. As a consequence, we confirm that any $5$-dimensional
complete noncompact Sasakian manifold with positive transverse bisectional
curvature and the maximal volume growth must be CR-biholomorphic to the
standard Heisenberg group $\mathbb{H}_{2}$ which can be stated as the standard
contact Euclidean $5$-space $\mathbb{R}^{5}$.

