 We highlight that, after a dimension-reduction argument, this result combined with \cite[Theorem 1.1]{EdelenLi2022} implies the bound $\dim_{{\mathcal H}}(\Sigma \cap \partial \Omega) \leq n-3$, improving the estimate given in \cite[Theorem 1.2 (1)]{EdelenLi2022}.

