 The question of the validity of the Vertex-skipping for $n \geq 3$ was already tackled in \cite{LeoVia_stability}. In that work, using a suitable Lipschitz flow of deformations for a free-boundary surface in a Lipschitz container $\Omega$, which in particular allows $\partial \Omega$ (including its singular set) to move, we establish a stability result for axial hyperplanes in circular cones, stated as follows.
