and $\lm_\ii\in (8\pi,\tfrac{8\pi}{1-2\sg}]$, if $\sigma\in(0,\tfrac{1}{4})$, or $\lm_\ii\in(8\pi,\tfrac{4\pi}{\sigma})$, if $\sg\in[\tfrac{1}{4},\tfrac12)$ and
\begin{equation}\label{profilevtilde:H1-IIb}
