\label{thm:SRW}
    For any infinite vertex-transitive strongly transient graph $\mathbb{H}$ of finite degree,
    \begin{equation*}
        \liminf_{n \to \infty} \PP_v\big(\Psi(G_n^\mathbb{H}) = v\big) > 0.
    \end{equation*}
