\begin{prop}\label{general case of cano trace}
Under Conventions \ref{conv of Schubert cycle} and \ref{conv of Schubert cycle2}, we assume that $B$ is a Gorenstein normal domain.
Then the canonical trace of $G_B(X; \g)$ is 
$$\prod_{h=1}^{\k-\k'}\Bigl( \bigcap_{i\in\U_h} J_B(x;\sigma_i) \Bigr).$$
