&=\frac{\log(\#\mc E_{n_B})}{|\log\ell|}-\frac{\log\left(\#\{E\in\mc E_{n_B}:E\cap B\neq \emptyset\}\right)}{|\log\ell|} \notag\\
&\overset{\eqref{eq:l}}{\geq} \frac{\log(\#\mc E_{n_B})}{(n+1)\log\rho_1}-\frac{\log\left(\#\{E\in\mc E_{n_B}:E\cap B\neq \emptyset\}\right)}{n\log\rho_1}. \label{eq:logmuB}
