$$\# \mc E_{n_B}\geq \dfrac{1}{2}\left(\rho(1-\rho^{-\eta})\right)^{n_k(1-\gamma)+n_B-(n_k^{(d)}+1)}\prod_{i=1}^{d} \floor*{\rho_i^{(n_k^{(d)}+1-n_k^{(i)})}} $$
