\begin{thm}\label{Hodge numbers}
    Let $X = X(\pi,\sigma)$ be a Kato manifold with Kato modification 
$\pi : \widehat{\mathbb{B}} \to \mathbb{B}$. 
Then we have the following relations for the Hodge numbers of $X$:
\begin{align*}
    h^{p,q}(X) &= h^{p,q}(\widehat{\mathbb{B}}),
\qquad q \neq 0,1,n-1,n\\
h^{p,0}(X) &= h^{n-p,n}(X) =
\begin{cases}
1, & p = 0 \\
0, & p \neq 0
