Let \((E,h^E)\to X\) be a Griffiths positive Hermitian holomorphic vector bundle of rank three over a complex manifold \(X\). Then the Schur forms
\[
P_{(2,1,0)}\bigl(c(E,h^E)\bigr)=c_1(E,h^E)\wedge c_2(E,h^E)-c_3(E,h^E)
\]
and 
\begin{equation*}
  P_{(2,0,0)}\bigl(c(E,h^E)\bigr)=c_2(E,h^E)
\end{equation*}
are weakly positive.
\end{prop}

