\begin{theorem}\label{t:main}
Let $t\geq 3$, $q$ be an odd prime power. For each $h \in \F_{q^{2t}} \setminus \F_{q^t}$ with $\mathrm{N}_{q^{2t}/q^t}(h)=-1$ and $$m \in 
