\mathbb{F}_{q^t} \setminus \bigl(\mathscr{P}_s^+ \cup \mathscr{P}_s^- \bigr),
& \text{if $t$ is even, or $t$ is odd and $q \equiv 1 \pmod{4}$}, \\[2mm]
\mathscr{P}_s^+,
& \text{if $t$ is odd and $q \equiv 3 \pmod{4}$,}
\end{cases}
$$
the $q^s$-linearized polynomial
 \begin{equation*}
