    &f_{1, 1, 2}^{1, 2, 2} = \underline{4X_{1,1}X_{1,2}X_{2,2}} + 2X_{1,2}^2X_{2,1}, \quad
    f_{1, 2, 2}^{1, 1, 2} = \underline{4X_{1,1}X_{2,1}X_{2,2}} + 2X_{1,2}X_{2,1}^2.
    \end{align*}
    The quotient $\mathbb{C}[X]/I_{4,2}$ has Krull dimension $0$ and degree $20$.
\end{example}

Our main result enumerates a vector space basis for $\mathbb{C}[X]/I_{m, k}$:

